PL/iSQL function test_hint_transaction(text) line 7 at EXECUTE
call test_hint_transaction('after');
ERROR:  invalid transaction termination
CONTEXT:  PL/iSQL function test_hint_transaction(text) line 13 at COMMIT
table test_hint_tab;
